The package includes subsets of a different work, AusTraits, with different
copyright holders and licence:

- data/austraits_lite.rda (the dataset `austraits_lite`), compiled from
  AusTraits' source after its 7.0.0 release;
- R/sysdata.rda (`austraits_5.0.0_lite`), internal data for the tests, from
  AusTraits 5.0.0.

inst/extdata/world_land.rds, the world map of plot_locations(), is made from
Natural Earth's 1:10m land polygons (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/),
which are in the public domain, by data-raw/world_land.R in the package's
GitHub repository.

`austraits_lite` comes from:

  Title:    AusTraits: a curated plant trait database for the Australian flora
  Version:  7.0.0.9000, compiled with traits.build 3.0.0 from commit
            a019d137ad73731bffd1a62aef2fbdfa2cbb7f48 of
            https://github.com/traitecoevo/austraits.build, whose compiled
            database is released under the licence below
  DOI:      https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3568417 (all versions)
  Holders:  the AusTraits contributors, listed in AusTraits' releases and in the
            `contributors` table of the dataset
  Licence:  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
            https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
            The `taxa` table, compiled from curated taxon lists such as the
            Australian Plant Census, is released under CC BY 3.0
            (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/).
  Changes:  compiled for 24 of its datasets only, by
            data-raw/austraits_lite.R in the package's GitHub repository
            (https://github.com/traitecoevo/traits.use).

The test data come in the same way from AusTraits 5.0.0
(https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10156222, 9 datasets), under CC BY 4.0.

Please cite AusTraits as: Falster D, Gallagher R, Wenk EH, et al. (2021)
AusTraits, a curated plant trait database for the Australian flora.
Scientific Data 8: 254. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-021-01006-6
and the original studies, listed in the dataset's `sources`.
